// textile-studio/strings.es.js - the Spanish UI strings of Textile Studio (keys as in strings.en.js).
//
// STRUCTURE (data table: header comment only, entries are not annotated)
// - One default-exported flat object: 'namespace.key' -> text. Same keys, same order and same section comments as
//   strings.en.js, so a line diff between two dictionaries shows exactly the missing / extra keys.
// - {name} placeholders are filled by t(key, vars) in ui/i18n.js; they must survive translation verbatim (a renamed
//   placeholder prints literally, it does not throw).
// - A key missing here falls back to English via ui/i18n.js (and is recorded in window.__edMissingKeys, which e2e.js
//   returns), so an incomplete translation degrades to mixed language, never to a raw key or a crash.
// - Values are plain text, inserted with textContent by the UI: no HTML, so no escaping is needed here.
